OL,3,APolanski vows to stay as Green leader
OL,4,Aas he faces criticism after by-election
OL,5,Adefeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FZack Polanski has vowed to stay on as
OL,8,FGreen Party leader after his
OL,9,Fby-election defeat, as he faced
OL,10,Fpressure from within his own party to
OL,11,Fresign.
OL,13,FThe leader of the Jewish Greens, Vivien
OL,14,FLichtenstein, said on Friday he should
OL,15,Fresign, adding it was a "big mistake"
OL,16,Ffor him to have dodged a debate about a
OL,17,Fparty conference motion that declared
OL,18,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
