OL,3,AKing pays Andrew's #1.5m repair bill on
OL,4,ARoyal Lodge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Crown Estate say they have not
OL,7,Fgiven any money to Mountbatten-Windsor
OL,8,Fat the conclusion of his lease and have
OL,9,Fnow received the net #1.5m payment they
OL,10,Fwere owed.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
