OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Achief, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer UN human rights chief and
OL,7,FInternational Court of Justice judge
OL,8,FNavi Pillay has been awarded the 2026
OL,9,FNobel Peace Prize.
OL,11,FThe South African judge was recognised
OL,12,F"for her efforts to promote peace and
OL,13,Finternational law", which paved the way
OL,14,Ffor a "more comprehensive global legal
OL,15,Forder", the Nobel committee said.
OL,17,FPillay, 85, has taken part in
OL,18,Fhigh-profile work considering
OL,19,Fallegations of human rights violations
OL,20,Fduring a decades-long career, including
OL,21,Fin Rwanda, Myanmar and Gaza.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
