OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has cast
OL,7,Fdoubt on the Pentagon's plans to
OL,8,Flivestream a firing squad execution of
OL,9,Fthe Fort Hood shooter.
OL,11,FTalking with reporters, Vance expressed
OL,12,Fdoubt that it would happen as planned,
OL,13,Fsaying: "I don't know that that's
OL,14,Factually going to happen".
OL,16,FHe added, that "if it's through live
OL,17,Fstream, I'm not going to be watching
OL,18,Fit". Vance described the actions by
OL,19,Fformer US Army major Nidal Hasan as
OL,20,F"the worst terrorist attack on American
OL,21,Fsoil outside of 9/11".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
