OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FHasan fatally shot 13 unarmed US
OL,7,Fsoldiers at Fort Hood in 2009, injuring
OL,8,Fanother 32. His execution by firing
OL,9,Fsquad would be the first military
OL,10,Fexecution in more than 60 years.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
